  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Localization project - Lebanon (2024 - 2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This localization project is to support the implementation of the Lebanese Red Cross&#x2019; WASH One Program Approach (OPA), focussing on the goals related to strengthening and innovation. In addition, this project aims to accelerate the digital transformation of LRC, with a specific focus on ICT capacity building through the support of an ICT compliance officer and digital Community Engagement and Accountability (CEA).</narrative>
  </description>
